WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.643
Experiments use hidden-state activations from four
models: the encoder and decoder of UnifiedQA T5-Large,

00:00:07.723 --> 00:00:12.497
DeBERTa, and GPT-Neo, averaged over five datasets
including BoolQ.

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:15.733
Contrast pairs append two exclusive answers,

00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:21.470
each set normalized independently so the probe
cannot detect the answer token.
